{"comment": "alice challenges bob to heads-up poker, bob accepts, and bob resigns in the first hand. The button, the cards and so who acts first come from the game's random seed, so they are placeholders here."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "alice", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "alice", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "bob", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "bob", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "challenge.create", "body": {"to": ["bob"], "game": "poker", "options": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": [], "game": "poker", "options": {}, "state": "pending", "by": null, "game_id": null, "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": [], "game": "poker", "options": {}, "state": "pending", "by": null, "game_id": null, "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "challenge.accept", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": ["bob"], "game": "poker", "options": {}, "state": "accepted", "by": null, "game_id": "$game", "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": ["bob"], "game": "poker", "options": {}, "state": "accepted", "by": null, "game_id": "$game", "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"comment": "Hand 1 is dealt with its blinds posted. Each player sees only its own hole cards, and only the seat to act gets its legal moves, what it must call and the range a bet or raise may go to (a street total); the other gets [] and zeros."}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "poker", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["$first"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"hand_no": 1, "button": "$button", "blinds": {"small": 10, "big": 20}, "board": [], "pots": [], "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "user": "alice", "stack": "$p1_stack", "bet": "$p1_bet", "folded": false, "allin": false, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "user": "bob", "stack": "$p2_stack", "bet": "$p2_bet", "folded": false, "allin": false, "out": false}], "legal": "$alice_legal", "to_call": "$alice_to_call", "min_raise_to": "$alice_min_raise_to", "max_raise_to": "$alice_max_raise_to", "my_cards": "$alice_cards", "last_hand": null}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "poker", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["$first"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"hand_no": 1, "button": "$button", "blinds": {"small": 10, "big": 20}, "board": [], "pots": [], "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "user": "alice", "stack": "$p1_stack", "bet": "$p1_bet", "folded": false, "allin": false, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "user": "bob", "stack": "$p2_stack", "bet": "$p2_bet", "folded": false, "allin": false, "out": false}], "legal": "$bob_legal", "to_call": "$bob_to_call", "min_raise_to": "$bob_min_raise_to", "max_raise_to": "$bob_max_raise_to", "my_cards": "$bob_cards", "last_hand": null}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"comment": "bob resigns: he leaves the table, his chips in the pot stay there and the rest of his stack leaves play, so he counts as folded, alice wins the hand and, alone at the table, the game. The summary scores are chip deltas."}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 3, "type": "game.control", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "control": "resign"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 3, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 1}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "poker", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": [], "result": {"kind": "decisive", "winners": ["alice"], "reason": "resign"}, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": [], "events": "$resign_events", "view": {"hand_no": 1, "button": "$button", "blinds": {"small": 10, "big": 20}, "board": [], "pots": [], "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "user": "alice", "stack": "$p1_final_stack", "bet": 0, "folded": false, "allin": false, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "user": "bob", "stack": 0, "bet": 0, "folded": true, "allin": false, "out": true}], "legal": [], "to_call": 0, "min_raise_to": 0, "max_raise_to": 0, "my_cards": "$alice_cards", "last_hand": "$last_hand"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": "$finished_at", "summary": "$summary", "digest": "$digest", "exports": {}}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "poker", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": [], "result": {"kind": "decisive", "winners": ["alice"], "reason": "resign"}, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": [], "events": "$resign_events", "view": {"hand_no": 1, "button": "$button", "blinds": {"small": 10, "big": 20}, "board": [], "pots": [], "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "user": "alice", "stack": "$p1_final_stack", "bet": 0, "folded": false, "allin": false, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "user": "bob", "stack": 0, "bet": 0, "folded": true, "allin": false, "out": true}], "legal": [], "to_call": 0, "min_raise_to": 0, "max_raise_to": 0, "my_cards": "$bob_cards", "last_hand": "$last_hand"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": "$finished_at", "summary": "$summary", "digest": "$digest", "exports": {}}}}
